# Allowlist: send only what the build needs.
# .env stays out on purpose: Vite would read it at build time; it only holds dev settings.
# node_modules stays out too: it holds macOS binaries, the image installs its own with npm ci.
*
!package.json
!package-lock.json
!tsconfig.json
!vite.config.ts
!index.html
!src/
!nginx.conf